# Hash keys & load metadata

## The hash key (`_hk`) — surrogate PK

```
customer_hk   = hash(customer_id)
order_line_hk = hash(order_hk + product_hk)
```
- A **deterministic** MD5/SHA of the business key(s)
- Same key → same hash **anywhere, no lookup**
- → hubs, links, sats load **independently, in parallel** (MPP scale)

## Load metadata — on every row

- **`load_date`** — when it entered; sequencing sats **is** the history
- **`record_source`** — origin (`web`/`pos`/`erp`) → **audit lineage**

## `hash_diff` — cheap change detection (satellites)

- Hash of **all attributes** · incoming vs latest:
- **Differs** → insert new version · **matches** → skip
- Same hash trick as the SCD-2 merge (module 06)
